# Google OAuth for ShortLinks — get real values from Google Cloud Console:
# APIs & Services -> Credentials -> OAuth 2.0 Client IDs
# (authorized redirect URI: http://localhost:5088/signin-google)
#
# Recommended: load them via user-secrets, never commit them:
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Authentication:Google:ClientId" "your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com"
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Authentication:Google:ClientSecret" "your-client-secret"
#
# Or as environment variables (double underscore = config section separator):
Authentication__Google__ClientId=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
Authentication__Google__ClientSecret=your-client-secret
